{
  "message": "Your devlog reports a second island and reef damage, but neither is demonstrated by gameplay or new artifacts. The reference tasks are closed, but halfway through, missing playable evidence puts the goal behind. This gap is common and still fixable here: drop the storyboard and share a playable two-island build next sprint. At the next review, I look forward to opening your build and reading your devlogs and updates ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Drop the trailer storyboard and plan around Alex’s remaining 20–30 hours; Mia’s availability remains unconfirmed.",
      "itemId": "cmvun2x2600jwcsz8e6von2yr",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "By the end of sprint 3, share a downloadable build with a short route between two placeholder islands, flooding and draining, and two-player sailing.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "In sprint 4, test that build with five players. Report what they completed, what failed, and what you learned.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

